      "text": "Instructions This quiz is timed, you need to complete it within 20 minutes of starting. Keep track of your answers and show your work on paper in your own handwriting. Upload a pdf of your work to Quiz 2A_asy_work in Gradescope within 5 minutes of exiting Proctorio. If your work is uploaded more than 5 minutes after finishing the Proctorio quiz, you will not receive credit. 76844952389acb69f15794ca8d2696872053526"
